IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`

-- Tests of aia-timeline.l4. Every expected value is written by hand from the text of Article 113 and
-- Article 111 (as enacted and as amended) and the Omnibus's Article 4, before the code was run.
-- A case on each side of: 27.7.2026, 2.2.2025, 2.8.2025, 2.8.2026, 2.12.2026, 2.12.2027, 2.8.2027,
-- 2.8.2028, 2.8.2030, 31.12.2030 (and 1.8.2024, the entry into force of the Regulation).
-- A line "-- EXPECT X" above a #TRACE is the outcome read from the text; work/tracecheck.py compares it
-- with what both stable builds print (a DEONTIC cannot be compared in an #ASSERT).

§ `Shorthand for the tests`

`the Annex III route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`the Annex I route` MEANS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
`no route` MEANS `the route to pass when no AI system is in question`
`no date` MEANS `the date to pass when no AI system is in question`

GIVEN g IS A `Provision group`
      d IS A DATE
      r IS A `Route to high-risk`
      p IS A DATE
      c IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the group applies` MEANS `Art 113 the provision group applies` g d r p c

GIVEN g IS A `Provision group`
      d IS A DATE
      r IS A `Route to high-risk`
      p IS A DATE
      c IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the group applies as enacted` MEANS `Art 113 as enacted the provision group applies` g d r p c

GIVEN g IS A `Provision group`
      d IS A DATE
      r IS A `Route to high-risk`
      p IS A DATE
      c IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the group applies as amended` MEANS `Art 113 as amended the provision group applies` g d r p c

§ `Entry into force: the Regulation (twentieth day after 12.7.2024) and the Omnibus (third day after 24.7.2026)`

-- Art 113 first paragraph: 12 July 2024 plus twenty days is 1 August 2024. Omnibus Art 4: 24 July 2026 plus three days is 27 July 2026.
#ASSERT `Art 113 the Regulation was published` EQUALS Date 12 7 2024
#ASSERT `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force` EQUALS Date 1 8 2024
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the Omnibus was published` EQUALS Date 24 7 2026
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the Omnibus enters into force` EQUALS Date 27 7 2026
-- Art 113 point (d) "27 July 2026" and the Omnibus's entry into force are the same day.
#ASSERT `Art 113(d) Articles 102 to 110 apply from` EQUALS `Omnibus Art 4 the Omnibus enters into force`
#ASSERT NOT (`Art 113 the Regulation is in force` (Date 31 7 2024))
#ASSERT `Art 113 the Regulation is in force` (Date 1 8 2024)

§ `The version function: a case on each side of 27 July 2026`

#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 1 8 2024) EQUALS `as enacted`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 24 7 2026) EQUALS `as enacted`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS `as enacted`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS `as amended`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 28 7 2026) EQUALS `as amended`
#ASSERT `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` (Date 2 12 2027) EQUALS `as amended`

§ `The dates themselves, as the text prints them`

#ASSERT `Art 113 second paragraph the general date of application` EQUALS Date 2 8 2026
#ASSERT `Art 113(a) Chapters I and II apply from` EQUALS Date 2 2 2025
#ASSERT `Art 113(a) the Article 5 additions apply from` EQUALS Date 2 12 2026
#ASSERT `Art 113(b) the group of Chapter III Section 4, Chapters V, VII, XII and Article 78 applies from` EQUALS Date 2 8 2025
#ASSERT `Art 113(c)(i) Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to Annex III systems from` EQUALS Date 2 12 2027
#ASSERT `Art 113(c)(ii) Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to Annex I systems from` EQUALS Date 2 8 2028
#ASSERT `Art 113(d) Articles 102 to 110 apply from` EQUALS Date 27 7 2026
#ASSERT `Art 113 as enacted the general date of application` EQUALS Date 2 8 2026
#ASSERT `Art 113(c) as enacted Article 6(1) and the corresponding obligations apply from` EQUALS Date 2 8 2027
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) as enacted the date before which a placed system is saved` EQUALS Date 2 8 2026

§ `Chapter I and Chapter II: 2 February 2025`

-- A case on each side of 2.2.2025 (the text as enacted is the text on those days); and one on a day under the text as amended.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter I` (Date 1 2 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter I` (Date 2 2 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter I` (Date 28 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter II` (Date 1 2 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter II` (Date 2 2 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter II` (Date 28 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
-- Before the Regulation exists nothing applies.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `General` (Date 31 7 2024) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter I` (Date 31 7 2024) `no route` `no date` FALSE)

§ `The Article 5 additions: 2 December 2026, and only in the text as amended`

#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Article 5 additions` (Date 1 12 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Article 5 additions` (Date 2 12 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Article 5 additions` (Date 3 12 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
-- As enacted the provisions did not exist (NOTHING-kind: silent), so the group never applies and its date is NOTHING.
#ASSERT `Art 113 as enacted the date of application` `Article 5 additions` `no route` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Article 5 additions` (Date 2 12 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `Art 113 as amended the date of application` `Article 5 additions` `no route` EQUALS JUST (Date 2 12 2026)
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Article 5 additions` (Date 2 12 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE)

§ `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Article 78: 2 August 2025`

#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` (Date 1 8 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` (Date 2 8 2025) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` (Date 28 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE

§ `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3: 2 December 2027 (Annex III) and 2 August 2028 (Annex I)`

-- Placed on the day of application, not before it, so Art 111(2) saves nothing; the date asked moves.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 1 12 2027) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2027) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 1 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE
-- Each route has its own date: on 2 December 2027 the Annex I route has not begun.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2027) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE)
-- On 2 August 2026, the old general date, Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 do not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE)
-- NOTHING-kind (silent): no date for a system that is not high-risk.
#ASSERT `Art 113 as amended the date of application` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `Route neither` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2030) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE)
#ASSERT `Art 113 as amended the date of application` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `the Annex III route` EQUALS JUST (Date 2 12 2027)
#ASSERT `Art 113 as amended the date of application` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `the Annex I route` EQUALS JUST (Date 2 8 2028)

§ `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 as enacted: 2 August 2026 (route Article 6(2)), 2 August 2027 (route Article 6(1))`

-- Read through the helper, because a date after 27 July 2026 is always under the text as amended.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 1 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 1 8 2027) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2027) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2027) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2027) FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 113 as enacted the date of application` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` `Route neither` EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Articles 102 to 110: 27 July 2026 as amended, 2 August 2026 as enacted`

-- 26 July 2026 is under the text as enacted (2 August 2026): not yet. 27 July 2026 is under the text as amended: from that day.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 26 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 27 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 1 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 2 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as amended` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 26 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as amended` `Articles 102 to 110` (Date 27 7 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE

§ `General: 2 August 2026`

#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `General` (Date 1 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `General` (Date 2 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `General` (Date 3 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE
-- As enacted the general date was the same day.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `General` (Date 1 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `General` (Date 2 8 2026) `no route` `no date` FALSE

§ `Article 111(2): a high-risk AI system already on the market is saved unless its design is significantly changed`

-- As amended, Annex III route: the date is 2 December 2027. Placed 1 December 2027 (before it), unchanged: saved, so the group does not apply.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2027) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 1 1 2030) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE)
-- The same system after a significant change in its design: not saved.
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2027) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE
-- Placed on 2 December 2027 (not before): not saved.
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 12 2027) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE
-- Annex I route: the date is 2 August 2028. Placed 1 August 2028: saved. Placed 2 August 2028: not saved.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 1 8 2028) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 1 8 2028) TRUE
-- The Annex I route reads its own date of application: a system placed 1 January 2028 is before 2 August 2028, so saved (fork F-111-2-date).
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2028) `the Annex I route` (Date 1 1 2028) FALSE)
-- Art 111(2) says "this Regulation": the saving reaches the General group too, for the operator of a saved high-risk system.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `General` (Date 3 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies` `General` (Date 3 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `General` (Date 3 8 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Notified bodies, GPAI, governance, penalties and Art 78` (Date 3 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE)
-- "Without prejudice to the application of Article 5": Chapter II and the Article 5 additions are never saved.
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Chapter II` (Date 3 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies` `Article 5 additions` (Date 2 12 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE
-- Chapter I is not named in the saving (fork F-111-2-chapter-I).
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies` `Chapter I` (Date 3 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE)
-- As enacted the fixed date was 2 August 2026: placed 1 August 2026, unchanged, saved; placed 2 August 2026, not saved; changed, not saved.
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2026) `the Annex III route` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE
-- As enacted, Annex I route: placed 1 August 2026 is saved; placed 15 December 2026 is not (the fixed date, not 2 August 2027).
#ASSERT NOT (`the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2027) `the Annex I route` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE)
#ASSERT `the group applies as enacted` `Chapter III Sections 1 to 3` (Date 2 8 2027) `the Annex I route` (Date 15 12 2026) FALSE

§ `Article 111(1): components of large-scale IT systems (Annex X), placed before 2 August 2027, comply by 31 December 2030`

-- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording) outside the rule; asked on 1 January 2026.
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the date by which the AI system must be brought into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the date by which the AI system must be brought into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the date by which the AI system must be brought into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 8 2027) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the date by which the AI system must be brought into compliance` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the date by which the AI system must be brought into compliance` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- Second subparagraph.
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the requirements of this Regulation are to be taken into account in the evaluation` (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the requirements of this Regulation are to be taken into account in the evaluation` (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the requirements of this Regulation are to be taken into account in the evaluation` (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 111(1) the requirements of this Regulation are to be taken into account in the evaluation` (Date 31 7 2024) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- The breach path: the operator brings the system into compliance on the last day (31 December 2030) or one day late.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 111(1) the duty to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT (Day (Date 31 12 2030))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 111(1) the duty to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT (Day (Date 1 1 2031))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 111(1) the duty to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 1 1 2031))
-- A system placed on 2 August 2027 is outside the rule: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 111(1) the duty to bring the AI system into compliance` (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 1 1 2031))

§ `Article 111(2) second sentence: public authorities, 2 August 2030, in both versions`

-- Both versions give the same date (the words changed from "of this Regulation" to "laid down in this Regulation").
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 2 8 2030)
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 2 8 2030)
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 1 1 2026) TRUE EQUALS `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 26 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 2 8 2030)
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST (Date 2 8 2030)
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 111(2) the date by which providers and deployers of high-risk AI systems intended for public authorities must comply` (Date 31 7 2024) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
