    PARTY Provider DOES `Art 111(2) take the necessary steps to comply with the requirements and obligations` AT (Day (Date 3 8 2030))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 111(2) the deployer's duty to take the necessary steps` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    PARTY Deployer DOES `Art 111(2) take the necessary steps to comply with the requirements and obligations` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2030))
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Art 111(2) the deployer's duty to take the necessary steps` (Date 1 1 2027) TRUE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2030))
-- Not intended for public authorities: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 111(2) the provider's duty to take the necessary steps` (Date 1 1 2027) FALSE AT (Day `Art 113 the Regulation enters into force`) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 3 8 2030))

